{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>近日有海外網友在社交平台上發帖求助，稱自己一輛2023款的特斯拉Model 3在夜間停車狀態下車內起火</strong>。從其發佈的照片看，起火的位置位於中控扶手杯架前方區域，已經被燒毀變形，裏面似乎還有不少雜物，甚至連頂棚和遮陽板也受到波及。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584300.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:22:15.903876+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:14:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:16.132906+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:16.132906+00:00","content_hash":"8a6ed9954b682c150dfe409f87703d76e07e64e858ad038ed556f97e0cc988da","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}